<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<span class="ltx_rule" style="width:487.8pt;height:2.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.0pt;">
EPT Benchmark: Evaluation of Persian Trustworthiness in Large Language Models 
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;">
<span class="ltx_rule" style="width:487.8pt;height:2.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:487.8pt;">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Mohammad Reza Mirbagheri, Mohammad Mahdi Mirkamali, Zahra Motoshaker Arani,</span>
<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Ali Javeri, Amir Mahdi Sadeghzadeh, and Rasool Jalili</span>
</span>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Department of Computer Engineering, Sharif University of Technology, Tehran, Iran<span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;"> 
<span id="id2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true">
</span> <span id="id2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Warning:</span> This paper may contain offensive contents in data and model outputs.</span>
